WEBVTT

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:12.830
Chief, I'm counting on you for the front page tomorrow: "The Reality of a Village Recovering from Thanatos Attacks."

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:16.780
Yeah, thanks for heading into another dangerous situation.

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:22.440
You have to go there yourself to see how things really are. If you don't, you can't make accurate reports.

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:26.100
Right, I'm off to do some more snooping!

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:30.060
Hey, Bernal!

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:32.190
Rosh...

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:36.900
This one's the Stellar Vessel and this one...

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:38.720
This girl?

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:39.880
Yeah.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:44.590
Just after I took this photo, she purified a bunch of Thanatos and she did it perfectly too.

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:48.850
I can't believe it... a girl like her fighting Thanatos?

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:52.220
Looks like the Foundation's guys are sniffing around her too.

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:58.160
The Queen's Egg... The legend that's meant to save Arcadia, huh?

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:04.860
The Wodon Times doesn't report on vague legends. Her identity needs some verification...

00:01:05.050 --> 00:01:07.380
If you're wanting to know where she is, I've already checked that out.

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:11.210
As efficient as ever!

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:14.120
Thanks.

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:19.430
Call it: "The Queen's Egg Appears!" It'll be a scoop for sure!

00:01:19.670 --> 00:01:23.530
Go to the Sunlit Mansion on the outskirts of Rhys. You'll find her there.

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:26.630
Her name is... Angelique.

00:01:27.370 --> 00:01:29.100
Angelique...

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:05.080
Phase 04: Black Attack

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:08.550
I've prepared some tea for everyone!

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:11.680
This isn't a fair game!

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:18.210
You say that now, but you agreed to play, didn't you?

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:20.730
Why don't you calm down a little?

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:22.520
That's right, Lein.

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:26.440
No, it's more than just coincidence that Nyx is winning every round.

00:03:26.490 --> 00:03:29.910
You're really good at card games so you chose one because you wanted to win, didn't you?

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:33.430
That's called being strategic.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:35.380
That's against the rules.

00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:41.800
Angelique...

00:03:46.510 --> 00:03:49.270
Excuse me, everyone...

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:51.270
Shall we have some tea?

00:03:52.450 --> 00:03:54.490
I apologize profusely, Angelique.

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:57.980
The tea you have so kindly prepared has become lukewarm.

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:00.680
Yet, it's delectable.

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:03.290
It's as though an angel has prepared it for us.

00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:09.010
You're all exaggerating.

00:04:09.170 --> 00:04:13.540
Anyway, why were you all playing cards?

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:18.380
To tell you the truth, we're going to have a banquet tonight.

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:20.300
A banquet?

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:22.130
Nyx suggested it.

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:25.620
A kind of party to get to know each another.

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:32.800
We all pride ourselves on our culinary skills, so we were playing a game to decide who would cook.

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:35.040
Then, I'd like to play as well.

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:37.100
No, that's all right.

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:41.000
At this banquet, we'll serve you.

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:48.010
If you have any dishes you'd like us to cook for you, please give us your requests.

00:04:48.090 --> 00:04:50.720
Requests?

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:55.690
I can't think of anything at the moment... cook whatever you want.

00:04:57.510 --> 00:04:59.570
Anyway, why Nyx?

00:04:59.890 --> 00:05:02.780
It's not fair to let him walk away with the victory just because he's a card shark.

00:05:02.850 --> 00:05:04.880
I demand a rematch.

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:07.110
My, my...

00:05:07.190 --> 00:05:12.590
If you insist, I don't mind playing something different.

00:05:14.390 --> 00:05:19.590
Then, let's have a duel, fair and square. Bang!

00:05:22.060 --> 00:05:23.700
I'd prefer not to.

00:05:23.830 --> 00:05:27.210
My spear exists only to protect Lady Angelique.

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:31.070
So, the former Silver Tree Knight's scared, is he?

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:34.700
I suppose a spear is no match for a ranged weapon, after all.

00:05:35.070 --> 00:05:36.880
Don't underestimate me, Lein.

00:05:36.950 --> 00:05:40.410
I can easily deflect your bullets with my spear.

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:41.770
Interesting.

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:43.730
Want to prove it?

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:46.290
Sounds like a challenge...

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:49.860
Um...

00:05:50.050 --> 00:05:54.560
Now, now... the contest has finished. Let's allow Nyx to sort out the cooking.

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:57.630
Jade, you can't...

00:05:57.670 --> 00:05:58.970
What?

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:03.250
He has no confidence in his culinary skills, so he's trying to avoid a rematch.

00:06:03.350 --> 00:06:04.960
Am I wrong?

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:06.670
Yeah...

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:08.370
I wonder.

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:11.340
Then, how about this:

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:13.920
You can all cook together.

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:16.460
All of us... together?

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:29.920
You really are useless.

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:33.110
We still don't have enough data.

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:37.410
He's here?

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:49.110
You're not as useless as them, are you?

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:54.930
I don't care what you have to do.

00:06:55.030 --> 00:06:59.340
Get me some data on this girl when she fighting Thanatos.

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:03.150
And, if possible, retrieve the original.

00:07:04.810 --> 00:07:08.750
If this operation succeeds, Director Yorgo will be most pleased.

00:07:09.370 --> 00:07:12.000
I'm counting on you, Jet.

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:21.560
It's all right, Erwin.

00:07:21.660 --> 00:07:24.240
I need to help out too.

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:33.020
Hey, Angelique.

00:07:33.830 --> 00:07:35.490
Jade?

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:42.130
I'm sorry about earlier.

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:47.270
Everyone just wants you to have delicious food to eat.

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:51.300
But for some reason, it worries me.

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:55.170
From now on, we're all going to be living together in the Sunlit Mansion...

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:56.530
It's okay.

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:58.360
We're companions.

00:07:58.420 --> 00:08:01.200
Eat something good and we'll smile.

00:08:01.260 --> 00:08:02.910
That's right.

00:08:02.990 --> 00:08:06.000
If they pool their efforts into one dish, they'll all become friends!

00:08:06.610 --> 00:08:08.510
One dish?

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:10.660
Well...

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:19.730
It looks good... flavor is the most important consideration when cooking meat.

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:23.110
Food tastes best when it's at its simplest.

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:25.340
Vegetables are also good for the brain.

00:08:25.620 --> 00:08:31.980
True cooking means being able to taste all the ingredients in their natural form. Sashimi is the ultimate dish.

00:08:32.640 --> 00:08:38.410
Wait... is everyone making their own dishes?

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:41.770
Yes, they all have different tastes...

00:08:42.010 --> 00:08:46.500
Shouldn't they all work together?

00:08:46.550 --> 00:08:49.250
Hey, my vegetables have vanished!

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:51.830
Have you seen them anywhere?

00:08:51.910 --> 00:08:53.950
What on Earth are you blabbering on about?

00:08:54.020 --> 00:08:55.400
Don't even try it.

00:08:55.460 --> 00:08:56.280
Give them back.

00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:58.410
But I need them too!

00:08:58.460 --> 00:09:00.040
I need them too!

00:09:00.090 --> 00:09:02.260
But I can't give them back...

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:13.600
Don't worry. They'll go well with the Sashimi.

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:15.410
Oh no they won't!

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:16.880
Give them back! Put them back!

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:18.080
Stop!

00:09:20.430 --> 00:09:22.480
Everyone just stop...

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:25.630
Oh, sorry.

00:09:30.520 --> 00:09:31.730
The flour!

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:34.830
Too late.

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:44.050
Why has it gone so badly?

00:09:44.130 --> 00:09:47.630
They should all just make the same dish together, Erwin.

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:52.610
But they all like different foods, don't they?

00:09:53.410 --> 00:09:55.610
Different foods...

00:09:55.730 --> 00:09:58.070
I've just had a brainwave, Erwin!

00:09:58.400 --> 00:10:01.060
Let's sneak out and do some shopping!

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:11.400
If they can't cook together...

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:25.100
Hello?

00:10:28.300 --> 00:10:30.350
You're Bernal, right?

00:10:30.470 --> 00:10:33.470
Hey there. It's been a while, Professor Lein.

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:36.010
I'm honored you still remember me.

00:10:36.080 --> 00:10:39.250
I'm no longer a professor. What do you need?

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:42.190
Actually, I wanted to have a chat with you guys.

00:10:42.230 --> 00:10:43.470
Us?

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:46.380
In particular, with a girl named Angelique.

00:10:46.380 --> 00:10:48.380
I see...

00:10:48.860 --> 00:10:54.270
You want to know about our goals?

00:10:54.390 --> 00:10:57.400
To purify the Thanatos and to save people.

00:10:57.460 --> 00:10:59.970
Why would you perform such dangerous tasks?

00:11:00.060 --> 00:11:02.300
It's humanitarian work.

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:07.470
I have heard that a certain girl has become involved in this charity work of yours.

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:10.700
Is it true that she's a Purifier?

00:11:11.460 --> 00:11:15.860
If it is true, do you intend to circulate that she is, in fact, the Queen's Egg?

00:11:16.140 --> 00:11:18.490
The Queen's Egg has nothing to do with this.

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:20.490
I just came to find the truth.

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:27.230
I suspected someone like this might show up eventually... what should we do?

00:11:27.340 --> 00:11:29.820
He interviewed me once.

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:31.760
He's not a bad reporter.

00:11:31.810 --> 00:11:33.180
We should just tell him.

00:11:33.260 --> 00:11:34.860
That's not your decision to make, Lein.

00:11:34.930 --> 00:11:37.980
It's Lady Angelique's decision.

00:11:38.070 --> 00:11:39.790
You have no say in this matter.

00:11:40.110 --> 00:11:41.020
You!

00:11:41.070 --> 00:11:43.560
Calm down, guys...

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:49.490
Anyway, I'd like to speak to her directly.

00:11:49.940 --> 00:11:51.340
Can I see her?

00:11:52.430 --> 00:11:55.860
Angelique left just a moment ago.

00:11:56.920 --> 00:12:00.070
She was carrying a basket; I think she was going shopping.

00:12:00.510 --> 00:12:02.230
Why didn't you say so earlier?

00:12:02.330 --> 00:12:05.400
You allowed her to leave the house unattended?

00:12:05.600 --> 00:12:09.920
Oh heavens, I don't think it's right to keep a lady constantly tied down.

00:12:10.490 --> 00:12:16.890
We've had no reports of Thanatos attacks, so there's no harm in letting her spread her wings a little, is there?

00:12:17.050 --> 00:12:19.610
No, your information is a bit out-of-date.

00:12:20.890 --> 00:12:23.740
I heard rumors of Thanatos heading this way.

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:26.130
It's nothing definite, but you should be on the lookout.

00:12:27.950 --> 00:12:29.440
We must protect her.

00:12:44.980 --> 00:12:46.430
No, Erwin.

00:12:46.510 --> 00:12:48.870
We'll get separated.

00:12:56.280 --> 00:12:58.180
You're...

00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:10.710
This person is somehow...

00:13:17.120 --> 00:13:22.870
Lead the subject to the target: success. Initiating data collection.

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:25.560
I hope she's okay...

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:26.630
Let's hurry.

00:13:26.810 --> 00:13:27.810
Yeah.

00:13:27.850 --> 00:13:30.150
Hey, why are you coming too?

00:13:30.220 --> 00:13:31.810
This is part of my research.

00:13:31.860 --> 00:13:34.370
I want to see her power.

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:36.760
I want to write the truth about her.

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:43.250
Who was that man?

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:49.350
Erwin...

00:13:49.810 --> 00:13:51.130
Erwin?

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:54.500
Is that you, Erwin?

00:13:56.300 --> 00:13:57.320
Erwin?

00:13:57.920 --> 00:13:59.130
Come here...

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:00.510
Erwin!

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:04.730
Erwin!

00:14:08.260 --> 00:14:09.550
A Thanatos!

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:16.300
Lady Angelique!

00:14:20.890 --> 00:14:22.510
I must do something.

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:24.940
It's all right...

00:14:25.900 --> 00:14:27.990
If I use my power, I'm sure...

00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:39.060
Light of Purification... please!

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:45.360
No!

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:47.290
This means... I can't do it alone?

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:53.630
Are you all right?

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:55.040
Hyuuga!

00:14:58.580 --> 00:14:59.370
Lein!

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:01.040
Now, Angelique!

00:15:01.150 --> 00:15:02.460
Yes!

00:15:10.750 --> 00:15:12.160
What's going on?

00:15:12.630 --> 00:15:15.730
The body of the Thanatos is transforming into orb particles...

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:26.670
There's nothing more to worry about.

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:30.610
You shouldn't even attempt to fight a Thanatos alone.

00:15:30.680 --> 00:15:31.760
Nyx...

00:15:32.170 --> 00:15:33.370
Can you stand?

00:15:33.810 --> 00:15:35.550
Thank you.

00:15:35.900 --> 00:15:37.630
Pleasure to meet you, Miss.

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:42.390
My name is Bernal. I'm a reporter for the Wodon Times.

00:15:43.550 --> 00:15:45.050
Bernal?

00:15:45.100 --> 00:15:48.910
Yes, I'd like to conduct a little interview with you.

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:54.950
More importantly, why did you go into the forest on your own?

00:15:55.040 --> 00:15:57.450
I warned you that the Thanatos appear more often there.

00:15:57.700 --> 00:15:59.670
I'm sorry.

00:15:59.760 --> 00:16:01.060
I...

00:16:07.050 --> 00:16:08.330
You're...

00:16:12.510 --> 00:16:14.460
Data collection complete.

00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:17.220
Initiating recovery of the original.

00:16:17.610 --> 00:16:19.580
He's from the Foundation...

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:22.850
Stay back, Angelique!

00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:26.380
This guy isn't normal!

00:16:26.870 --> 00:16:28.960
You can't be...

00:16:39.590 --> 00:16:41.270
We're at a disadvantage when fighting at close quarters!

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:42.390
Leave it to me!

00:16:47.680 --> 00:16:48.530
He's fast...

00:16:48.570 --> 00:16:49.100
Lein!

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:50.020
Hyuuga!

00:16:50.220 --> 00:16:51.940
No, Angelique!

00:16:52.020 --> 00:16:52.810
But..

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:54.870
You can't let your guard down!

00:17:11.400 --> 00:17:13.650
You're.... you're...

00:17:13.710 --> 00:17:14.840
You're...

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:18.490
defective.

00:17:24.030 --> 00:17:24.990
Everyone!

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:26.370
No, stay back.

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:29.420
I can't put your life in danger.

00:17:29.640 --> 00:17:32.410
I'm going to fight with everyone else.

00:17:32.550 --> 00:17:33.840
That's impossible...

00:17:36.040 --> 00:17:37.380
She's shaking?

00:17:39.510 --> 00:17:41.480
Let me hear your words.

00:17:41.560 --> 00:17:44.070
You're forcing yourself to fight.

00:17:44.150 --> 00:17:47.670
You really don't want to fight, do you?

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:51.820
No, that's not true.

00:17:53.280 --> 00:17:58.030
I vowed to save everyone who suffers at the hands of the Thanatos.

00:17:58.080 --> 00:18:02.500
Even when I can't manage alone, everyone else helps out.

00:18:02.620 --> 00:18:03.550
So...

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:06.800
This time, I'll help everyone else out.

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:13.320
I'll help the people I care about!

00:18:13.590 --> 00:18:14.970
Angelique!

00:18:25.490 --> 00:18:26.780
What's this?

00:18:26.860 --> 00:18:28.900
My body is filling with power.

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:31.370
A healing light, huh?

00:18:36.490 --> 00:18:37.630
Please...

00:19:00.260 --> 00:19:01.840
Recovery is impossible.

00:19:01.920 --> 00:19:03.450
Withdrawing.

00:19:19.580 --> 00:19:22.520
He's the same as me?

00:19:24.650 --> 00:19:28.440
He lured you to where the Thanatos appeared.

00:19:29.020 --> 00:19:30.630
Is that right?

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:32.050
Yes.

00:19:32.260 --> 00:19:35.650
He had the mark of the Foundation on his arm.

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:39.500
I've heard that the Foundation is investigating you.

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:41.380
I'll look into that.

00:19:41.430 --> 00:19:43.120
Okay, thanks.

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:50.010
Angelique, will you let me tell the world of your existence?

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:57.550
I know the truth about who you're fighting for.

00:19:57.650 --> 00:20:00.100
I want to tell everyone about it.

00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:08.540
If that will help, then please do.

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:11.530
I'm sure it will.

00:20:13.660 --> 00:20:15.610
Okay, I'll be going then.

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:20.630
Man, what a pompous nincompoop.

00:20:21.260 --> 00:20:25.010
By the way, what were you off to buy?

00:20:25.060 --> 00:20:26.780
Oh, this...

00:20:28.050 --> 00:20:30.570
Pears?

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:33.520
Would anyone like to make a pear pie with me?

00:20:34.560 --> 00:20:38.690
Even though everyone is cooking different dishes, I'd like to cook the same dessert for everyone.

00:20:39.070 --> 00:20:41.600
This is my request.

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:44.310
That's a wonderful idea.

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:46.670
Indeed.

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:51.760
I understand!

00:20:51.940 --> 00:20:54.100
We're companions, right?

00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:55.150
Yes.

00:21:02.080 --> 00:21:08.730
It's still not certain whether she's the legendary Queen's Egg or not.

00:21:09.150 --> 00:21:13.940
But it's true that it was her power that purified the Thanatos...

00:21:14.900 --> 00:21:18.540
It turned them into the Orbs: the light that's contained within all things.

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:34.560
They are the people's light of salvation: the Orb Hunters.

00:23:12.790 --> 00:23:16.610
The Queen's Egg, born into this world under the sign of the Aurora.

00:23:16.760 --> 00:23:19.530
At last, we've found her.

00:23:20.100 --> 00:23:23.330
I can finally see her, right?

00:23:26.230 --> 00:23:27.920
I'm looking forward to it, Mathius.

00:23:28.240 --> 00:23:31.200
So am I, Rune.

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:38.580
A summons from the Head of the Order.

00:23:38.630 --> 00:23:39.850
Sermons.

00:23:40.440 --> 00:23:43.460
Endless sermons in a dark chapel...

00:23:43.540 --> 00:23:44.290
Next time:

00:23:44.350 --> 00:23:45.750
The Journey of Determination.

00:23:45.810 --> 00:23:49.600
The Queen's Egg's enthusiasm has halved.
